# Local machine overrides and setup backups for this dotfiles repo only
**/work
**/personal

**/local
**/local.*
**/*.local
**/*.local.*

**/backup
**/backup.*
**/*.backup
**/*.backup.*

!**/*.example

# OpenCode 2 background-server settings, including a generated password
opencode/service.json

# Homebrew-generated third-party tap trust store; never tracked
homebrew/trust.json*

# opencode session artifacts (plans, scratch); never tracked
/.opencode/
